Kronos (https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos) is licensed under the MIT
License (see LICENSE in this directory). Dipcatcher's robinhood+ engine
implements the Kronos two-stage K-line foundation-model framework
(hierarchical discrete tokens + autoregressive decoder) and can optionally
load official Hugging Face weights (NeoQuasar/Kronos-*).

Paper: Shi et al., 2025. Kronos: A Foundation Model for the Language of
Financial Markets. arXiv:2508.02739.

robinhood+ is an internal Dipcatcher engine name. It is not affiliated with
Robinhood Markets, Inc.
